XMRIS V4.01 changes from 4.00

some minor typos fixed

mismatched extern/static function declarations fixed

some casts put in to shut up compilers

bug found in scrollbar widget and workaround installed

xmred segfault on startup fixed (not enough room in nadger_widget_tree array)

Saved unsaved dialog segfault fixed

Redo/undo confusion fixed

Imakefile fiddled with to remove gnumake switch and dynamically
check that the make is kosher

Key detection on keycodes doesn't work when a keysym is bound to more
than one keycode. Keysyms used instead.

Iconizing with keyboard loses autorepeat.

ansiknr included after Intrinsic.h as sun's Intrinsic breaks CONST

the BSD signal handing was broke, and is now fixed. (I don't know,
V3 had broken SYSV signal handling. May be its impossible to have
source that works wth both BSD and SYSV :-)

xmred -h no longer says -sprites is an option

garden search path increased to include score directory
